# [MOQ](../wg/moq.html)

## Summary

The Media over QUIC (MOQ) Working Group met at IETF 127 in San Francisco. The session focused on adopted working group specifications beyond the core transport, including low-overhead container formats, authorization mechanisms, denial-of-service (DoS) resource protection, and object acknowledgment feedback mechanisms. Key technical discussions covered the MPEG liaison regarding LOCMAF, recent design updates to [draft-ietf-moq-transport](https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/draft-ietf-moq-transport/), DoS protection around fill fetches and redirects, authorization patterns in [draft-ietf-moq-c4m](https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/draft-ietf-moq-c4m/), property registration in [draft-ietf-moq-loc](https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/draft-ietf-moq-loc/), and application-level object feedback.

