## Decisions and Action Items

1. **[draft-ietf-moq-c4m](https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/draft-ietf-moq-c4m/) Key Thumbprints**: `draft-ietf-moq-c4m` will require support for both JSON Key Thumbprint (JKT) and COSE Key Thumbprint (CKT).
2. **[draft-ietf-moq-c4m](https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/draft-ietf-moq-c4m/) Coalescing**: Request updates that alter authorization parameters or broaden scope must not be coalesced.
3. **[draft-ietf-moq-loc](https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/draft-ietf-moq-loc/) Property Registrations**: Reject bulk importing of RTP header extensions or WebCodecs dictionaries as opaque blobs; properties will continue to be evaluated and mapped individually for relay compatibility.
4. **LOCMAF Work**: Working group chairs will discuss the MPEG liaison response offline and determine next steps on the mailing list.

